          <groundspeak:date>2016-09-17T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="985002">Strider&#39;s Ride</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP717 Valley Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The last cap find of the day and much like the last cap, this one was found in a deep depression next to a road. The main differences were this one was deeper, had filled in with much more dirt and debris, had a huge growth of thistles and was next to a roadway that  was positively humming with activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
