ELEV = 1026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I HAD TO DIG THRU A WALL OF 2 FOOT THISTLES AND TAKE 3 &quot; OF GRAVEL OFF IT 

WE PERCEVERED..&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="606777950">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-06-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP717 - Valley Road&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt; N53° 25.324' W117° 31.758'

&lt;strong&gt;My GPSr:&lt;/strong&gt; N53° 25.323' W117° 31.760'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was my first stop on my day trip to Hinton today and since I'd already re-coned the spot with Google Street View I was kind of like arriving at a familar place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After parking on the side road, finding the cap was a breeze: it's pretty hard to miss the large hole it in. Thanks to those who excavated it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="600631877">
          <groundspeak:log_wpt lat="53.422067" lon="-117.529300" />
          <groundspeak:date>2016-05-15T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="321730">Sleepy_hollow</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP717 - Valley Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were on our way to Grande Prairie for a little work and decided to stop in and check out this interesting location. Great spot in a fine town - thanks OFTH for setting it up!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
