          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BrassCap BCP717 Valley Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A little beat up down in it's hole but a nice cap none the less and almost within walking distance of home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have a cache 157 metres to the north &lt;a href="http://coord.info/GCXTAF" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;GCXTAF&lt;/a&gt; if you'd like to bag another cache at the same stop.&lt;/p&gt;
